+	  AIS receiver and decoder for ANTSDR E200. It reads the local
+	  cf-ad9361-lpc RX DMA directly through libiio, decodes AIS-A and
+	  AIS-B, serves NMEA on TCP 10110 and its vessel map on HTTP 8100.
